{
  "_readme": [
    "Grover Tex Prints ki staff list — `npm run db:seed-users` isse users banata hai.",
    "",
    "Kaise chalti hai:  npm run db:seed-users            (local .env wale DB par)",
    "                   npm run db:seed-users -- --live  (Hostinger par, HTTPS API se)",
    "",
    "Dobara chalane par jo email pehle se hai wo SKIP ho jaata hai — kisi ka",
    "password ya data overwrite nahi hota. Isliye ise jitni baar chahe chalao.",
    "",
    "staff_type sabka 'office' hai — jaan-boojh kar. App me office/factory toggle",
    "hata diya gaya hai aur admin ka view hamesha 'office' par tika hai",
    "(frontend/js/app.js: SEGMENT). 'factory' likhne par wo bande admin ki users",
    "list aur task-assign dropdown dono me se gayab ho jaate hain.",
    "",
    "Jinke paas email nahi hai (sr 11 Bappi, aur sr 35/36/37) unhe jaan-boojh kar",
    "chhoda hai — email hi login ID hai, uske bina account ka koi matlab nahi.",
    "",
    "week_off = '0' matlab Sunday chhutti. (App waise bhi Sunday ko poori",
    "company ki chhutti maanti hai — lib/workdays.js — par yahan likhne se UI",
    "me Sunday tick dikhta hai.)",
    "",
    "Naya banda joine kare to bas neeche list me ek line jodo aur script",
    "dobara chala do."
  ],
